WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Lily approaches after the ordinary medium-Spire knockdown.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.500
Lily retreats as Ryu attempts the recorded throw.

3
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Standing heavy punch punishes the missed throw.

4
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Forward heavy punch continues the punish.

5
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Heavy Condor Wind finishes the punish and gains a Wind stock.

6
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Ryu falls after the heavy Wind finish.
